  "headline": "FDA's records show the metoclopramide hydrochloride supply chain relies on multiple plants with VAI inspection histories; no OAI or warning letters are recorded for the registered sites",
  "headline_cites": ["E7", "E12", "E17", "E23", "E25"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The product label (SPL set 95269b1f) lists five registered plants for metoclopramide hydrochloride NDC 72089030715: ACM Pharma (France), COSMA S.p.A. (Italy), Intertek (UK), Patheon France SAS (France), and SGS France (France) [E7, E12, E17, E23, E25].",
      "cites": ["E7", "E12", "E17", "E23", "E25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for each plant show only Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI) classifications across the most recent inspections: ACM Pharma VAI on 2024-01-24 [E6], COSMA S.p.A. VAI on 2022-06-17 [E11], Intertek VAI on 2023-06-30 [E16], Patheon France SAS VAI on 2023-09-29 [E22], and SGS France VAI on 2024-01-19 [E24].",
      "cites": ["E6", "E11", "E16", "E22", "E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No Official Action Indicated (OAI) classifications, warning letters, or import alerts appear in the provided FDA records for any of these facilities.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21", "E22", "E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 44 units with 5 days on hand at 8.9 units per day [D1], while Corvale General holds 257 units with 29 days on hand at 8.8 units per day [D2].",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based transfer option moves 82 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, leaving Corvale General with approximately two weeks of supply and bringing Corvale East to approximately 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the evidence links are weak and no FDA enforcement action explains the shortage, verify current allocation status with the manufacturer (Evoke Pharma, Inc.) and confirm whether any recent supply interruptions have been reported for NDC 72089030715.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E7"]
    }
  ]
}
